1
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,272
=Episode 18=

2
00:00:13,465 --> 00:00:14,228
Jin Yunlie,

3
00:00:14,876 --> 00:00:16,322
can you please stay?

4
00:00:16,476 --> 00:00:18,227
Can't you stay with me a little longer?

5
00:00:20,361 --> 00:00:21,618
I want to stay with you too.

6
00:00:22,152 --> 00:00:23,027
But I believe

7
00:00:23,752 --> 00:00:24,741
that even without me,

8
00:00:24,894 --> 00:00:26,419
you can keep living, and live well.

9
00:00:27,219 --> 00:00:27,980
So,

10
00:00:28,171 --> 00:00:28,666
for me,

11
00:00:29,923 --> 00:00:31,333
please don't give up.

12
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,190
Jin Yunlie!

13
00:00:34,495 --> 00:00:35,028
No!

14
00:00:36,095 --> 00:00:36,589
No!

15
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:41,952
♪The reeds will fade,
and reunion may bring longing♪

16
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:47,424
♪Green buds wither.
Does my old love still wait?♪

17
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:52,304
♪When deadwood blooms,
the world turns beautiful♪

18
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:57,520
♪I'm afraid the snow will melt♪

19
00:00:58,342 --> 00:00:59,103
It worked.

20
00:01:03,792 --> 00:01:08,010
♪I fear this longing
will turn my hair white♪

21
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:15,168
♪Your tears can defeat
an army of thousands♪

22
00:01:21,122 --> 00:01:21,999
Xi Yuan.

23
00:01:23,218 --> 00:01:25,351
I have very little Spiritual Power left.

24
00:01:25,847 --> 00:01:27,294
This is all I can do for you.

25
00:01:27,789 --> 00:01:29,351
If we meet again,

26
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:30,685
I hope

27
00:01:31,714 --> 00:01:33,466
you'll possess the power
to slay a deity.

28
00:01:47,446 --> 00:01:47,980
Xi Yuan.

29
00:01:48,552 --> 00:01:50,000
Now that you have a phoenix body,

30
00:01:50,494 --> 00:01:51,142
maybe this time,

31
00:01:51,865 --> 00:01:53,314
we'll actually succeed.

32
00:01:58,495 --> 00:02:01,122
But if you ever find out
I orchestrated all of this,

33
00:02:02,228 --> 00:02:03,637
you might hate me for it.

34
00:02:26,647 --> 00:02:27,447
Who are you?

35
00:02:53,122 --> 00:02:53,885
Jin Yunlie.

36
00:02:55,027 --> 00:02:56,132
You won't die.

37
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:04,742
Nirvana.

38
00:03:09,046 --> 00:03:09,809
Jin Yunlie.

39
00:03:10,723 --> 00:03:11,790
You can't die.

40
00:03:14,989 --> 00:03:15,752
Jin Yunlie.

41
00:03:30,571 --> 00:03:31,180
I'm fine.

42
00:03:31,751 --> 00:03:32,780
We're alive.

43
00:03:38,418 --> 00:03:38,914
This is...

44
00:03:38,914 --> 00:03:39,600
We're alive.

45
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,514
We're alive!

46
00:03:50,571 --> 00:03:51,637
Xi Yuan.

47
00:03:52,247 --> 00:03:53,161
Yunlie.

48
00:03:54,037 --> 00:03:55,294
Where are you?

49
00:04:08,552 --> 00:04:09,390
Miss Xi Yuan.

50
00:04:09,847 --> 00:04:11,484
Did you save us?

51
00:04:13,352 --> 00:04:18,151
Thank you!

52
00:04:19,751 --> 00:04:20,703
Xi Yuan.

53
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,360
Yunlie...

54
00:04:25,008 --> 00:04:25,960
What happened to Yunlie?

55
00:04:31,370 --> 00:04:32,285
Phoenix.

56
00:04:33,694 --> 00:04:35,028
Jin Yunlie is dead.

57
00:04:37,428 --> 00:04:39,447
Why couldn't I save him

58
00:04:40,132 --> 00:04:41,541
even with the Phoenix's power?

59
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,714
(I was still too late.)

60
00:04:44,589 --> 00:04:45,427
(His soul)

61
00:04:45,846 --> 00:04:47,865
(is probably already crossing
the River of Oblivion.)

62
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,104
(Once the dead
begin crossing the river,)

63
00:04:51,789 --> 00:04:53,922
- (they can never come back to life.)
- River of Oblivion?

64
00:05:10,837 --> 00:05:11,942
(River of Oblivion.)

65
00:05:34,989 --> 00:05:37,199
(Ferrying Souls Across Oblivion.)

66
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:41,466
(Six steps to forget your past.)

67
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,733
(First step, forget fame and rank.)

68
00:05:47,027 --> 00:05:49,504
(Second step, forget your knowledge.)

69
00:05:50,722 --> 00:05:53,503
(Third step, forget
your closest friends.)

70
00:05:54,571 --> 00:05:58,380
(Fourth step, forget your loved ones.)

71
00:06:00,628 --> 00:06:02,380
(When you cross the River of Oblivion,)

72
00:06:03,714 --> 00:06:05,504
(do not look back.)

73
00:06:14,890 --> 00:06:18,816
♪I hate your back,
endless, blank, and never clear♪

74
00:06:18,830 --> 00:06:21,440
♪Watching me weep, yet you stay silent♪

75
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:27,152
♪I hate how you cast me aside,
yet no room for a word♪

76
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:31,968
♪I hate my silence, my fading self,
and my lack of spite♪

77
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:33,296
♪Yet I still hope you'll save me♪

78
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:36,620
♪By the end,
I'm just your leftover compromise♪

79
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:43,040
♪All the excuses I made for you
are so absurd♪

80
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:54,016
♪My regret came too late,
I finally see your true face♪

81
00:06:55,232 --> 00:07:01,040
♪My shattered promises struggle,
how can I let go♪

82
00:07:01,856 --> 00:07:07,160
♪Stripped bare, tormented.
I flinch at every feeling♪

83
00:07:07,584 --> 00:07:14,080
♪Forced to yield,
I flee before I fall apart♪

84
00:07:17,275 --> 00:07:17,885
Mother.

85
00:07:18,723 --> 00:07:19,447
Xi Yuan.

86
00:07:19,941 --> 00:07:21,466
I can't forget either of you.

87
00:07:22,490 --> 00:07:27,616
♪I hate how you cast me aside,
yet no room for a word♪

88
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:32,368
♪I hate my silence, my fading self,
and my lack of spite♪

89
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:33,664
♪Yet I still hope you'll save me♪

90
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:37,104
♪By the end,
I'm just your leftover compromise♪

91
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:39,792
♪All the excuses I made for you♪

92
00:07:39,827 --> 00:07:40,589
Yunlie.

93
00:07:42,647 --> 00:07:43,408
Yunlie.

94
00:07:46,342 --> 00:07:47,104
(Queen of Huyun Kingdom, Xing)
Yunlie.

95
00:07:48,247 --> 00:07:48,666
Yunlie.

96
00:07:48,666 --> 00:07:49,200
Mother.

97
00:07:51,027 --> 00:07:51,866
Mother.

98
00:07:54,571 --> 00:07:55,333
Yunlie.

99
00:07:59,180 --> 00:08:00,628
Mother, I've missed you so much.

100
00:08:02,913 --> 00:08:03,714
Yunlie.

101
00:08:05,541 --> 00:08:06,265
Mother.

102
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,666
I've missed you so much.

103
00:08:11,675 --> 00:08:13,200
Mother, I've missed you so much.

104
00:08:23,828 --> 00:08:25,161
It's not safe to stay here.

105
00:08:25,390 --> 00:08:26,875
Let's talk somewhere else.

106
00:08:38,037 --> 00:08:38,532
Mother.

107
00:08:38,532 --> 00:08:39,027
Come here.

108
00:08:39,865 --> 00:08:41,160
Mother, I've missed you so much.

109
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:41,657
Good boy.

110
00:08:41,846 --> 00:08:42,380
Come.

111
00:08:42,647 --> 00:08:43,522
It's time for bed.

112
00:08:50,952 --> 00:08:51,714
This is...

113
00:08:53,619 --> 00:08:55,218
You were timid as a child

114
00:08:55,446 --> 00:08:57,428
and never wanted to sleep alone.

115
00:08:57,847 --> 00:08:58,609
Go to sleep.

116
00:08:59,941 --> 00:09:00,704
Mother.

117
00:09:02,266 --> 00:09:03,219
Ever since you died,

118
00:09:03,371 --> 00:09:04,323
I've missed you so much.

119
00:09:10,723 --> 00:09:11,714
My child.

120
00:09:13,123 --> 00:09:14,038
All these years,

121
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:15,942
you've suffered so much.

122
00:09:18,495 --> 00:09:18,952
Mother.

123
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:21,618
Since you haven't crossed
the River of Oblivion

124
00:09:22,038 --> 00:09:23,180
and were able to wake me,

125
00:09:23,789 --> 00:09:24,285
does that mean

126
00:09:24,932 --> 00:09:26,342
we can go back together?

127
00:09:28,019 --> 00:09:30,152
I've been a wandering spirit for years.

128
00:09:30,684 --> 00:09:31,980
It was my obsession

129
00:09:32,285 --> 00:09:33,884
that kept me lingering on until now.

130
00:09:34,419 --> 00:09:35,028
Just now, I was only able

131
00:09:35,294 --> 00:09:38,037
to bring you here with a secret art.

132
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:41,542
There's no chance I can return to life.

133
00:09:42,722 --> 00:09:43,294
But Yunlie,

134
00:09:43,828 --> 00:09:45,009
you can still go back.

135
00:09:45,009 --> 00:09:45,504
Mother,

136
00:09:45,961 --> 00:09:47,295
I'm taking you back with me.

137
00:09:49,923 --> 00:09:50,684
My child,

138
00:09:51,294 --> 00:09:52,703
we don't have much time.

139
00:09:52,703 --> 00:09:54,227
I only have time
to tell you a few things.

140
00:09:54,227 --> 00:09:55,257
Listen to me.

141
00:09:56,284 --> 00:09:57,351
Your father

142
00:09:58,609 --> 00:09:59,713
may have already fallen
to demonic corruption

143
00:09:59,713 --> 00:10:00,780
and lost all sense of self and humanity.

144
00:10:04,544 --> 00:10:10,430
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

145
00:10:11,168 --> 00:10:17,310
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

146
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:24,110
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

147
00:10:24,110 --> 00:10:31,000
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
